# Optional. Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables.
# ElevenLabs → Profile → API Keys (NOT the Agent ID). After Save, Vercel hides
# the value — that is normal. Tick Production, then Redeploy.
# If the dashboard will not save it, paste lib/intake-prompt.js into the
# ElevenLabs agent Prompt tab instead; the widget can run without this key.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

